### Forgot Password - Step 1: Request OTP
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/forgot-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user@example.com"
}

###

### Forgot Password - Step 2: Verify OTP and Get Reset Token
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/forgot-password/verify-otp
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user@example.com",
  "otp": "123456"
}

###

### Forgot Password - Step 3: Reset Password with Reset Token
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/reset-password
Authorization: Bearer {{resetToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "newPassword": "NewSecurePass123!",
  "confirmPassword": "NewSecurePass123!"
}

###
